background-clip: text; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">PREFACE</span></p></section></section><section style=\"margin: -60px 0px 10px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(150, 0, 0); padding: 0px 40px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"text-align: right; white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">前言</strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center; justify-content: center; display: flex; flex-flow: row; margin: 30px 0px -80px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block; width: 95%; vertical-align: top; align-self: flex-start; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; background-color: rgb(246, 241, 235); box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"margin: 40px 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); text-align: justify; line-height: 2; padding: 0px 30px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">2024年5月23日-25日，2024花椒（沈阳）餐博大会暨第十一届东北新餐饮博览会（简称“花椒餐博大会”）在沈阳新世界博览馆圆满举行。本次大会整合全产业链资源，25000㎡展出面积、5大专区21+品类，万种爆品食材，同期举办10+产业专业活动，聚合餐饮市场商机，把握机遇新风口，从服务、运营、管理、法务、食安等多维度展开，与1000+餐饮人共襄盛会。</p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin: 150px 0px 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 10px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">PART 01</strong><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"></p></section></section><section style=\"margin: -30px 0px 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 60px; padding: 0px 20px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span style=\"color: transparent; background-image: linear-gradient(rgb(238, 225, 203) 0%, rgb(255, 255, 255) 88%); display: inline-block; background-clip: text; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">MEETING</span></p></section></section><section style=\"margin: -60px 0px 10px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(150, 0, 0); padding: 0px 40px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">盈科沈阳·博望&amp;花椒餐博大会</strong></p></section></section><section style=\"margin: 30px 0px 10px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light; color: rgb(38, 41, 42); text-align: left; line-height: 2; padding: 0px 15px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">北京盈科（沈阳）律师事务所（简称“盈科沈阳”）作为花椒餐博大会的法律顾问与合作伙伴全程参与，并为东北餐饮食品领域第一盛会的成功举办保驾护航。</p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; display: flex; flex-flow: row; margin: 10px 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: top; width: 50%; align-self: flex-start; flex: 0 0 auto; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0px; line-height: 0; transform: translate3d(5px, 0px, 0px); box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"vertical-align: middle; display: in